                                                "sense_id": "1a9cee01-1991-3778-8a34-4da1da5d780c",
                                                "text": "Peugeot, one of France’s premier car companies, confirmed last week that it was well along in discussions with a presanctions partner, the Iranian auto company Khodro, to build cars in Iran and transfer French technology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5c21e2f-caff-44af-8e1a-a61b7c3919e3",
                                                "sense_id": "1a9cee01-1991-3778-8a34-4da1da5d780c",
                                                "text": "Intelligence gathered by the Mossad in Iran also gave Israel’s air force the ability to target senior Iranian commanders and scientists."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
